[{"answer":"Hello. Jonathan Briggs, isn't it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-3-2023-08-14-20-27-20/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, that's right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-3-2023-08-14-20-27-20/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Do come in and sit down.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-3-2023-08-14-20-27-20/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Thanks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-3-2023-08-14-20-27-20/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-3-2023-08-14-20-27-20/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, Jonathan, as we explained in your letter,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-3-2023-08-14-20-27-20/6.mp3"},{"answer":"in this part of the interview, we like to talk through your application form...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-3-2023-08-14-20-27-20/7.mp3"},{"answer":"your experience to date, etc....","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-3-2023-08-14-20-27-20/8.mp3"},{"answer":"and then in the second part,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-3-2023-08-14-20-27-20/9.mp3"},{"answer":"you go for a group interview.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-3-2023-08-14-20-27-20/10.mp3"},{"answer":"Group interview... yes, I understand...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-3-2023-08-14-20-27-20/11.mp3"},{"answer":"So... your first degree was in Economics?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-3-2023-08-14-20-27-20/12.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, but I also did Politics as a major strand.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-3-2023-08-14-20-27-20/13.mp3"},{"answer":"And you graduated in 1989.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-3-2023-08-14-20-27-20/14.mp3"},{"answer":"And I see you have been doing some teaching...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-3-2023-08-14-20-27-20/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes. I worked as a volunteer teacher in West Africa.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-3-2023-08-14-20-27-20/16.mp3"},{"answer":"I was there for almost three years in total from....","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-3-2023-08-14-20-27-20/17.mp3"},{"answer":"1990 to... 1992.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-3-2023-08-14-20-27-20/18.mp3"},{"answer":"How interesting.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-3-2023-08-14-20-27-20/19.mp3"},{"answer":"What organisation was that with?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-3-2023-08-14-20-27-20/20.mp3"},{"answer":"It's not one of the major ones. It's called Teach South.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-3-2023-08-14-20-27-20/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-3-2023-08-14-20-27-20/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I have heard of it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-3-2023-08-14-20-27-20/23.mp3"},{"answer":"It operates in several African countries, doesn't it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-3-2023-08-14-20-27-20/24.mp3"},{"answer":"And what kind of school was it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-3-2023-08-14-20-27-20/25.mp3"},{"answer":"A rural co-operative.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-3-2023-08-14-20-27-20/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, a rural co-operative, how interesting...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-3-2023-08-14-20-27-20/27.mp3"},{"answer":"and what did you teach?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-3-2023-08-14-20-27-20/28.mp3"},{"answer":"A variety of things in different years...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-3-2023-08-14-20-27-20/29.mp3"},{"answer":"I did... with Forms 1 to 3 mainly Geography","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-3-2023-08-14-20-27-20/30.mp3"},{"answer":"and some English with Form 5.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-3-2023-08-14-20-27-20/31.mp3"},{"answer":"Then in my final year,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-3-2023-08-14-20-27-20/32.mp3"},{"answer":"I took on some Agricultural Science with the top year...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-3-2023-08-14-20-27-20/33.mp3"},{"answer":"that's Form 6.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-3-2023-08-14-20-27-20/34.mp3"},{"answer":"Right. Quite a variety then...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-3-2023-08-14-20-27-20/35.mp3"},{"answer":"I also ran the school farm.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-3-2023-08-14-20-27-20/36.mp3"},{"answer":"How interesting...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-3-2023-08-14-20-27-20/37.mp3"},{"answer":"And how did you find the whole experience?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-3-2023-08-14-20-27-20/38.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll be honest with you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-3-2023-08-14-20-27-20/39.mp3"},{"answer":"At the end of the first year I really wanted to leave and come home.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-3-2023-08-14-20-27-20/40.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, why was that?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-3-2023-08-14-20-27-20/41.mp3"},{"answer":"Well... I was very homesick at first and missed my family...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-3-2023-08-14-20-27-20/42.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I can understand that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-3-2023-08-14-20-27-20/43-2023-09-10-12-11-44.mp3"},{"answer":"and I also found it frustrating to have so few teaching resources,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-3-2023-08-14-20-27-20/44.mp3"},{"answer":"but I did decide to stay","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-3-2023-08-14-20-27-20/45.mp3"},{"answer":"and in the end I extended my tour to a third year.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-3-2023-08-14-20-27-20/46.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-3-2023-08-14-20-27-20/47.mp3"},{"answer":"Things must have looked up then?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-3-2023-08-14-20-27-20/48.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes. We set up a very successful project breeding cattle to sell locally.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-3-2023-08-14-20-27-20/49.mp3"},{"answer":"Really?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-3-2023-08-14-20-27-20/50.mp3"},{"answer":"And then after a lot of hard work we finally got funds for new farm buildings.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-3-2023-08-14-20-27-20/51.mp3"},{"answer":"And you wanted to see things through?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-3-2023-08-14-20-27-20/52.mp3"},{"answer":"And that's why you want to train to teach Geography?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-3-2023-08-14-20-27-20/53.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-3-2023-08-14-20-27-20/54.mp3"},{"answer":"I've had a couple of jobs since then","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-3-2023-08-14-20-27-20/55.mp3"},{"answer":"but I now realise I like teaching best.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-3-2023-08-14-20-27-20/56.mp3"},{"answer":"And I chose Geography because...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-3-2023-08-14-20-27-20/57.mp3"},{"answer":"because it is my favourite subject...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-3-2023-08-14-20-27-20/58.mp3"},{"answer":"and also because I think it has so many useful applications.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-3-2023-08-14-20-27-20/59.mp3"},{"answer":"Well... you certainly have had some interesting work experience.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-3-2023-08-14-20-27-20/60.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll ask you now to go on to the next stage...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-3-2023-08-14-20-27-20/61.mp3"}]
